      "eyebrow": "The short version",
      "heading": "We do not sell your data.",
      "html": "<p class=\"site-words\">Quickler is paid for by subscription, GBP 75 per phone number a month. Nobody else pays us to see your Records. There are no adverts inside Quickler, and we do not sell your data to anyone.</p>\n<p class=\"site-words\">We do send your content to a small number of outside companies so the product can work. This page says which ones, what each does with it, and what they have published about it. Where we could not prove something, we left it out.</p>"
    },
