      "html": "<p class=\"site-words\">You can download any Record as a PDF, a web page, a spreadsheet (Excel and CSV), and a Word document where the Check has one switched on, with its photos, documents and WhatsApp messages. There is also a Download all data option in the dashboard that gives you everything as a zip.</p>"
