      "html": "<p class=\"site-words\">Messages, photos, voice notes and transcripts are deleted automatically three years after the last activity on a Record. Filed Records and their PDFs are kept three years, then deleted, or sooner if you delete them. Backups are kept for 30 days.</p>\n<p class=\"site-words\">If you remove a person from your Contacts, their filed reports stay, with their name on them, so your compliance history stays whole. Full erasure of one person's conversations, photos, voice notes and transcripts is done on request: email <a href=\"mailto:hello@quickler.co\">hello@quickler.co</a>.</p>\n<p class=\"site-words\">Anyone with a Record's share link can open it, with its photos and downloads, for 365 days, unless the Record is deleted first.</p>"
